  "releaseNotes": "v4.9.10: Wasm residual large-sort race fix under heavy contention. Broadcast codegen now uses a per-group atomic tag handshake (writer publishes value + group tag; readers wait for tag match before consuming slot), hardening scan/broadcast correctness under full-sweep churn and Fallout76-class CPU pressure. Validation: two full Wasm sweeps clean (459/0/4 each) and two concurrent FO76 contention sweeps clean (1664/0/149 each, RunState=Done).",
